{"title":"2025 CEMC TUC Problems/Relay B Problem 1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Relay_B_Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>What number should be subtracted from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> to give the result of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/8/3683f227b0b53e6a30087db2fa3b752965ecf05d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-6$\" width=\"22\" height=\"12\" />?\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Relay_B_Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> be the number. We have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/1/1/f112ce9c88aa0b2a613d9a2d87b22a6696a70469.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2 - x = -6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"91\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/a/8ca495499c6224acb6e3380e8d813c45c73d983e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x - 6 = 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"77\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/4/f/04fe66df135e5b1eebb394d23eee95a870970bea.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 2 + 6 = \\boxed{8}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"121\" height=\"25\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_TUC\" title=\"2025 CEMC TUC\">2025 CEMC TUC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_TUC_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2025 CEMC TUC Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_TUC_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2025 CEMC TUC Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Relay_A_Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2025 CEMC TUC Problems/Relay A Problem 4 (page does not exist)\">Relay A Problem 4</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Relay_B_Problem_2\" title=\"2025 CEMC TUC Problems/Relay B Problem 2\">Relay B Problem 2</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2025 CEMC TUC Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2025 CEMC TUC Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2025 CEMC TUC Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2025 CEMC TUC Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/ind